### Create a new genre
POST https://ash-book-review.onrender.com/genres
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Science Fiction",
  "description": "A genre of speculative fiction that explores imaginative and futuristic concepts."
}

###

### Get all genres (after creating at least one)
GET https://ash-book-review.onrender.com/genres
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get a single genre by ID (replace {id} with the actual ID from the creation response)
GET https://ash-book-review.onrender.com/genres/{id}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Update an existing genre (replace {id} with the actual ID from the creation response)
PUT https://ash-book-review.onrender.com/genres/{id}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fantasy",
  "description": "A genre of speculative fiction set in a fictional universe often inspired by mythology and folklore."
}

###

### Delete a genre (replace {id} with the actual ID from the creation response)
DELETE https://ash-book-review.onrender.com/genres/{id}
Content-Type: application/json

###
